== Rules ==
Chronomancer with new Temporal Paradox pet, no class or pet changes. Pet Ability Power increased based on pet level. (1.15 ^ pet lvl)

Gain Unique Time Helix spell. (Time Fork, level requirement = pet level) 

==Scaling==

{| class="wikitable" style= "max-width:800px"
|- 
! colspan="2" | Overall Scaling to Profits
|-
| Inc ^7.39
|-
| Pap ^2
|-
| Char Exp ^? (Valuable since Char lvl = pet lvl)
|-
| Idle, Profit, CaP, VpE, Void Mana ^1
|-
| Evo ^0.016
|}

==Attributes==
<small>SPC provides very little - Need 250 for Kilt in snap, next is 150 for Amp & Torc in Amp, it may be better to invest 150 points in SPC and forgo Kilt. Needs testing.</small>
* Fill for items (Requires quite a lot - {{ItemTooltip|Blessed Tapestry}} is your friend for 1sec points)
* Important Perks
* Spc & Wis left at 240+10.
* Dom left at 0
* Rest fully cap before Vers

== Items ==

== Phases ==

A typical run consists of

* Level Pet (Be able to still cast Time Fork)
* Stack Spells 
* Pet Levelling phase (As much as possible so you can no longer cast TF)
* Skip Time
* Void Mana Phase 
* Quick Burst Phase to get upgrades and sources.
* Void Mana Phase
* Burst Phase

